      "message": "test: use mocktime in p2p_tx_privacy.py\n\nThe test waits 60 seconds for tx2's announcement yet the node holds it\nbehind a random delay with no upper bound. An unlucky draw fails the\ntest even when the node behaved as expected. Raising the timeout lowers\nthat chance without removing it.\n\nFreeze the node's clock before peers connect then advance it once tx2 is\nqueued thus releasing the announcement instead of waiting for it. The\ndelay itself and the single announcement assertion are unchanged.",
      "committer": {
